Python Repository Standards & Best Practices
Based on comprehensive code review and modernization practices
🏗️ PROJECT STRUCTURE (MANDATORY)
Standard Layout
project-name/
├── src/project_name/              # ✅ ALWAYS use src/ + package namespace
│   ├── api/                       # RESTful endpoints & DTOs
│   │   ├── __init__.py
│   │   ├── routes.py             # FastAPI route definitions
│   │   └── dto/                  # Data transfer objects
│   │       ├── requests.py
│   │       └── responses.py
│   ├── services/                  # Business logic (plural form)
│   │   ├── __init__.py
│   │   └── *.py                  # Service implementations
│   ├── repositories/              # Data access (full name, not "repo")
│   │   ├── __init__.py
│   │   ├── interfaces.py         # Repository patterns
│   │   └── *_repository.py       # Implementations
│   ├── models/                    # Domain entities
│   │   ├── __init__.py
│   │   ├── enums.py              # Proper enums (StrEnum, IntEnum)
│   │   └── *.py                  # Pydantic models
│   ├── config/                    # Configuration management
│   │   ├── __init__.py
│   │   └── settings.py           # Pydantic Settings
│   └── utils/                     # Shared utilities
│       ├── __init__.py
│       └── *.py                  # Utility functions
├── docker/                        # Environment separation
│   ├── dev/                       # Development containers
│   │   ├── Dockerfile
│   │   ├── docker-compose.yml
│   │   └── .env.dev              # Local only (NOT committed)
│   └── prod/                      # Production containers
│       ├── Dockerfile             # Multi-stage, optimized
│       ├── docker-compose.yml
│       └── .env.prod             # Local only (NOT committed)
├── tests/                         # Test organization
│   ├── __init__.py
│   ├── test_services/
│   ├── test_repositories/
│   └── test_api/
├── docs/                          # Documentation
├── main.py                        # Application entry point
├── pyproject.toml                 # UV dependencies
├── .env.example                   # Safe template (committed)
├── .gitignore                     # Comprehensive exclusions
├── .pre-commit-config.yaml        # Code quality automation
└── README.md                      # Project documentation
Why src/package_name/ Structure?
Clear Namespace: from package_name.models import Job (professional)
No Conflicts: Prevents collision with system modules
Packaging Ready: Can pip install package-name
Team Clarity: Obvious project identity in imports
Industry Standard: How professional Python packages are structured
🚫 ZERO HARDCODING RULE (CRITICAL)
Configuration Centralization
# ✅ ALWAYS: Single source of truth in settings.py
from pydantic_settings import BaseSettings

class Settings(BaseSettings):
    # API Configuration
    api_host: str = "127.0.0.1"
    api_port: int = 8080
    api_timeout: float = 30.0
    
    # Processing Configuration
    max_retries: int = 3
    batch_size: int = 10
    max_concurrent: int = 5
    
    # AI Model Configuration
    openai_model: str = "gpt-4"
    gemini_model: str = "gemini-pro"
    
    # External API Keys
    openai_api_key: Optional[str] = None
    
    class Config:
        env_file = ".env"

settings = Settings()
