❌ API endpoints, ports, hosts
❌ Model names, AI parameters
❌ File size limits, timeouts
❌ Batch sizes, concurrency limits
❌ Progress thresholds, retry counts
❌ Cost calculations, pricing
❌ File paths, directory names
